From: CBOC-Vita <344212538+CBOC-Vita@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 13:10:41 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 74/76] gl: keep recoloured HD textures as DXT1/DXT5 instead of
 RGBA8

Recoloured pack textures were rebuilt on the loader thread and uploaded as
RGBA8. They are now encoded with a small built-in DXT encoder and uploaded
compressed (8x less memory and bandwidth). HD_RECOLOUR_DXT=0 restores RGBA8;
HD_RECOLOUR_CHECK=1 reports PSNR per texture.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
